NAME
     rev - reverse lines of a file

SYNOPSIS
     rev [ file ] ...

DESCRIPTION
     _R_e_v copies the named files to the standard output, reversing
     the order of characters in every line.  If no file is speci-
     fied, the standard input is copied.

SEE ALSO
     tail(1)

